    "reconstructionNotes": "Exact almost-circular 19m BAG parent has a straight entry edge on its NNE side. Eight bent slate/shingle dome panels, four segment dormers, ring clerestories, twin former men/women portals and a central chimney follow Museum Het Schip primary architectural photos. Geometry height capped at latest OSM/3DBAG11.7m. The venue history says1913 while Museum Het Schip dates1920-1921 and OSM1922; no historical date has been inserted into gameplay."
