    "reconstructionNotes": "Whole former Timorplein technical school, including Stayokay and office wings, is the indivisible mapped BAG/OSM relation parent, not a cinema-only block. Outer74.58x51.08m plan and inner irregular courtyard retained; internal workshop connectors remain lower than four street wings. Arcam primary photos locate the corner clock tower at southwest, west twin gables/hostel entry, and long south StudioK frontage under1960s glazing band. Current3DBAG AHN4 roof50p18.922NAP, terrain0.506NAP; tower ridge28.119NAP=>27.61m above terrain. Catalogue addition only; no expansion of current teaching pool."
